          "type": "text",
          "title": "Reported market conditions",
          "text": "Management reported that AI-driven memory and storage demand growth exceeded the company’s and industry’s ability to increase supply in fiscal Q3 2026. It also reported supply allocation decisions and increased pricing and profitability amid robust DRAM and NAND demand and constrained supply.",
          "status": "reported",
          "evidence": {
            "source_id": "sec_mu_10q",
            "quote": "The AI-driven growth in the data center has accelerated demand for memory and storage at a rate greater than our ability and the industry’s ability to increase supply."
          }
        },
